verse.lines:
Nsanyuse,nsanyuse,
Yesu yannaazaak(o) ebibi;
Y(e) anjagaza by'ayagala;
Ansanyus(a) ennaku zonna;
Nsanyuse,nsanyuse;
Yesu yannaazaak(o) ebibi.

Nsanyuse,nsanyuse,
Yesu yannaazaak(o) ebibi;
Y(e) anjagaza by'ayagala;
Ansanyus(a) ennaku zonna;
Nsanyuse,nsanyuse;
Yesu yannaazaak(o) ebibi.

Nsanyuse,nsanyuse,
Yesu yannaazaak(o) ebibi;
Y(e) anjagaza by'ayagala;
Ansanyus(a) ennaku zonna;
Nsanyuse,nsanyuse;
Yesu yannaazaak(o) ebibi.

Nalayira nti ndi wuwo;
Naakyogeranga bulijjo;
Era mu ntuuko-ez'okufa
Ndisanyuka-okba-owuwo.

Nsanyuse,nsanyuse,
Yesu yannaazaak(o) ebibi;
Y(e) anjagaza by'ayagala;
Ansanyus(a) ennaku zonna;
Nsanyuse,nsanyuse;
Yesu yannaazaak(o) ebibi.
